GF(2⁸) multiply / scalar `columns`).\n\nNo `unsafe` is used except for two `transmute`s between `__m128i` and `[u8; 16]` in `g_mult_sse`, which are required because `__m128i`'s opaque internals can't be inspected from safe Rust. No FFI, no `unimplemented!`/`todo!`/`panic!` placeholders remain."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":559,"cache_read_input_tokens":51161,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":559,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"640e7b92-30e2-4649-bfb9-40490261efa2","uuid":"e8b02f2c-51df-4638-b993-d7582801de5a"}
